# Google Calendar sync — OAuth 2.0 client credentials.
# Create these at https://console.cloud.google.com: a project with the Calendar API
# enabled, and an OAuth client of type "Desktop app".
#
# For a Desktop-app client, the "client secret" Google issues is not a real secret —
# installed apps cannot keep one (RFC 8252 §8.5), and PKCE is the actual protection —
# but Google's token endpoint still requires it to be sent.
#
# Copy this file to .env (gitignored) and fill in both values.
MAIN_VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
MAIN_VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
